@host = http://localhost:5000

### A lesson: 50 points (60 before 7am UK time)
POST {{host}}/users/ada/lessons/fractions-1/complete

### A quiz scored 85: 20 points. Try score=70 for none.
POST {{host}}/users/ada/quizzes/fractions-quiz/submit?score=85

### Balance, lifetime points and level
GET {{host}}/users/ada/points

### Points history, newest first
GET {{host}}/users/ada/history

### Achievements
GET {{host}}/users/ada/achievements

### The reward catalogue (copy a reward id from here)
GET {{host}}/rewards

### Redeem a reward: returns a code such as RW-7K3QX9
POST {{host}}/users/ada/rewards/PASTE-REWARD-ID/redeem

### Staff: pending redemptions
GET {{host}}/admin/redemptions?status=Pending

### Staff: hand it over, or cancel it (cancelling refunds the points once)
POST {{host}}/admin/redemptions/PASTE-REDEMPTION-ID/fulfil?staff=front-desk

### Staff: a correction with a reason
POST {{host}}/admin/users/ada/adjust?staff=front-desk
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": 25, "note": "Lesson credit missed during the outage" }

### Staff: the rules as they apply to Northbridge Academy
GET {{host}}/admin/rules

### Staff: programme stats
GET {{host}}/admin/stats
